      "resource_id": "closing-interview",
      "label": "Closing interview",
      "media_type": "text/markdown",
      "content": "# Closing interview\n\nMara Vale says she returned after a late call, but first denies entering the records room. When shown the key register she admits that she opened the door for the clerk.\n"
    },
    {
      "resource_id": "key-register",
      "label": "Key register",
      "media_type": "text/markdown",
      "content": "# Records-room key register\n\n| Time | Holder | Action |\n|---|---|---|\n| 8:42 p.m. | E. Finch | Staff key signed out |\n| 9:11 p.m. | E. Finch | Staff key returned |\n"
    },
    {
      "resource_id": "camera-log",
      "label": "Camera log",
      "media_type": "text/markdown",
      "content": "# Exterior camera review\n\nThe north-window camera recorded an uninterrupted empty walkway from 8:30 p.m. through 9:20 p.m. The window latch remained visibly closed.\n"
    },
    {
      "resource_id": "cash-receipt",
      "label": "Cash receipt",
      "media_type": "text/markdown",
      "content": "# Unfiled payment receipt\n\nReceived from Northline Holdings: **$4,000 cash**. Purpose entered as records assistance. The receipt bears the clerk's initials but no ledger posting number.\n"
    }
